  "details": "- Initial backport of PostgreSQL 11.22 for RHEL 7\n- Based on Fedora/RHEL 8 spec files for PostgreSQL 10 and 12\n- Adapted for RHEL 7 compatibility:\n  - Disabled ICU support by default (not readily available on RHEL 7)\n  - Disabled plpython3 by default (may need SCL for Python 3)\n  - Removed perl-generators BuildRequires\n  - Removed multilib-rpm-config BuildRequires\n  - Added libs, devel subpackages for libpq and other shared libraries",
